+
+  # Here's how we divide up the progress bar:
+  #  0.1 for verifying the start state (PatchCheck calls)
+  #  0.8 for applying patches (ApplyPatch calls)
+  #  0.1 for unpacking verbatim files, symlinking, and doing the
